{"seq":2,"slug":"ocr-engine-training-postprocess","title":"OCR 引擎训练与后处理：数据合成、字典建模与置信度校准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/ocr-detection-recognition-engine/ocr-engine-training-postprocess","wordCount":2953,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"ocr-引擎训练与后处理-数据合成-字典建模与置信度校准\">OCR 引擎训练与后处理：数据合成、字典建模与置信度校准</h1><p>上一篇把检测/识别拆成 DBNet + CRNN 的网络结构，但架构图本身识别不了任何一个字符——真正决定引擎在你那批发票、提单、装箱单上表现如何的，是三件在网络结构之外的事：<strong>喂什么数据训练</strong>、<strong>字符集怎么定义</strong>、<strong>输出的概率怎么变成可信的字段</strong>。同一套 PP-OCRv5 权重，换成自己合成的纵排中文样本重训识别头，票据字段准确率能从 70% 出头拉到 90%；反过来，不校准置信度的引擎会给出一堆「0.99 分但完全错」的金额，让下游抽取层无法判断该不该报人工复核。</p>\n<p>本文承接 <a href=\"text-detection-recognition-fundamentals\"><code>1_text-detection-recognition-fundamentals.md</code></a> 的算法基础，聚焦从「已有网络结构」到「可上线引擎」之间那段工程：数据合成引擎、字典与 tokenizer 设计、训练目标与困难样本挖掘、置信度校准、以及词典校正等后处理。版面切块与表格结构还原属于本 hub 第 3 章；版式大模型（VLM）的端到端识别另载第 4 章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把「网络结构」变成「可上线引擎」的三根支柱：<strong>数据合成</strong>（解决标注稀缺与长尾覆盖）、<strong>字典建模</strong>（定义识别头的输出空间与语言边界）、<strong>置信度校准</strong>（把过度自信的 softmax 分数变成可用的阈值依据）。三者之外还有一层<strong>后处理门控</strong>——用领域先验做校验与拒绝，而非用语言模型去猜不可猜的字段。这四件事与网络架构正交：换主干网络只影响精度上限，而它们直接影响引擎在真实单据分布上的可用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练数据引擎-真实标注换不来的-靠合成补\">训练数据引擎：真实标注换不来的，靠合成补</h2><p>识别是<strong>数据饥渴</strong>任务：CRNN 要收敛到工业可用精度，通常需要数百万级文本行样本，而真实标注按字符框/行框计价，成本极高，且长尾（罕见字、生僻符号、极端字体）几乎采不到。主流做法是<strong>真实标注打底 + 合成数据覆盖长尾</strong>。合成引擎本质是一个「文本 → 逼真图像」的渲染器，其复杂度分三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>覆盖能力</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 基础渲染</td>\n<td>系统字体直接渲染，无背景</td>\n<td>字体多样性</td>\n<td>自建 PIL/OpenCV 脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 场景合成</td>\n<td>文字贴到真实照片上，做透视/光照/遮挡</td>\n<td>自然场景 OCR</td>\n<td>SynthText（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1604.06743\">arXiv:1604.06743</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 文档合成</td>\n<td>版式模板 + 纸张纹理 + 扫描退化链</td>\n<td>票据/表单/证件</td>\n<td>自建，参考 PP-OCR 合成器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境电商文档场景必须走 L3，因为它的难点不在「花哨背景」，而在<strong>扫描退化</strong>：低 DPI 传真件、复印多代的灰底、装订线的阴影、印章覆盖金额、表格线穿过文字。合成时若只渲染干净文字，模型上线后遇到印章叠加的金额就整行失败。可复现的退化链包含：高斯模糊、运动模糊（模拟扫描拖动）、二值化噪声、JPEG 压缩块（传真/微信转发图的典型损伤）、仿射与透视扰动、以及与印章/水印的 alpha 混合。</p>\n<p>一个容易踩的坑是<strong>合成与真实的域差</strong>：纯合成训练的模型在真实扫描件上会跌点。PP-OCR 的做法是检测与识别都混入真实数据微调，并用「合成:真实」比例（常见 1:1 到 4:1）以及难度分层采样来平衡。PaddleOCR 官方仓库同时开放了 PP-OCRv5 的多语言权重与训练配置，可作为自建训练流水线的起点（<a href=\"https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR\">PaddleOCR</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字典建模-字符集就是模型的输出空间\">字典建模：字符集就是模型的输出空间</h2><p>识别头的最后一层是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 维分类器，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>字典</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = |\\text{字典}| + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字典</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（+1 为 CTC 的 blank）。<strong>字典直接定义了模型能吐出什么</strong>，因此它是最容易被低估的设计决策。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>字符集大小</strong>：只做英数标点的引擎字典约 100 维；PP-OCRv5 多语言模型覆盖 <strong>109 种语言</strong>，其字典需统一容纳拉丁、CJK、西里尔、阿拉伯、天城文等字符，规模到数千至数万维（<a href=\"https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR\">PaddleOCR</a>）。分类层越大，同量数据下每类样本越稀疏，收敛越慢。</li>\n<li><strong>blank 与 CTC</strong>：CTC 在字符间插入 blank 处理「重复字符」与「空帧」。<code>hello</code> 里的 <code>ll</code> 必须靠 blank 分隔，否则序列坍缩会把它压成一个 <code>l</code>。字典里绝不能出现与 blank 冲突的符号。</li>\n<li><strong>语言无关化（BPE/subword）</strong>：与其为每种语言维护字符表，不如用 BPE 把字符聚合成子词单元。ABINet、TrOCR 等路线在文本侧采用 subword 建模，能显著缩小输出空间并共享跨语言表示（TrOCR，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2109.10282\">arXiv:2109.10282</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>生僻字与符号</strong>：跨境电商文档里常见 <code>€ £ ¥ ₩ ₫ ฿</code>、上下标、圈号 <code>①</code>、连字 <code>ﬁ</code>。训练前必须做<strong>字符覆盖率审计</strong>：统计真实标注语料中出现但字典缺失的字符（OOV 率），OOV 率高说明字典漏项，模型会把这些字符系统性识别成最相近的已见字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>字典还应与<strong>规范化策略</strong>一起定义：是把全角/半角、繁/简、大小写分别当独立类别（模型学区分），还是在后处理阶段统一归一？前者让模型更累，后者会把「订单号里的 O 和 0」这类必须区分的场景也一并抹平。稳妥做法是字典保留原字符，规范化放到<strong>字段级后处理</strong>按语义处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练目标与困难样本挖掘\">训练目标与困难样本挖掘</h2><p>检测与识别的损失目标是两套。检测侧 DBNet 对概率图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 用二值交叉熵、对阈值图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 用 L1 距离，并对正样本加权以对抗前景/背景像素极度不平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = L_s + \\alpha \\cdot L_b + \\beta \\cdot L_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为概率图 BCE、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为可微二值化图 BCE、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为阈值图 L1，论文取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=\\beta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（DBNet，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.08947\">arXiv:1911.08947</a>）。识别侧 CTC 的目标是最大化对所有能坍缩成目标串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>CTC</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{CTC}} = -\\log P(y \\mid x) = -\\log \\sum_{\\pi \\in \\mathcal{B}^{-1}(y)} \\prod_{t=1}^{T} P(\\pi_t \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CTC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3443em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0304em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际训练中，<strong>困难样本挖掘</strong>对精度的贡献往往大于换主干网络。可操作的三个杠杆：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>在线困难负样本</strong>：检测器把「分类正确但 IoU 低」的框加入下一轮难例池，抑制粘连文字漏检。</li>\n<li><strong>置信度加权 / Focal Loss</strong>：对已学好的易分类像素降权，把梯度集中到难像素（Focal Loss，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1708.02002\">arXiv:1708.02002</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>按字段难度分层</strong>：对票据场景，把「金额、日期、订单号」这类关键字段的错误样本加权，因为评价引擎的最终指标是字段准确率而非整行 CER。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[真实标注语料] --&gt; D[混合采样器]&#10;    B[合成数据引擎 L3] --&gt; D&#10;    C[困难样本池] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[检测训练 DBNet]&#10;    D --&gt; F[识别训练 CRNN/CTC]&#10;    E --&gt; G[推理产出预测]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[置信度校准]&#10;    H --&gt; I[后处理: 词典/规则]&#10;    I --&gt; J[字段准确率评估]&#10;    J --&gt;|未达标| C\">graph TD\n    A[真实标注语料] --&gt; D[混合采样器]\n    B[合成数据引擎 L3] --&gt; D\n    C[困难样本池] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[检测训练 DBNet]\n    D --&gt; F[识别训练 CRNN/CTC]\n    E --&gt; G[推理产出预测]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[置信度校准]\n    H --&gt; I[后处理: 词典/规则]\n    I --&gt; J[字段准确率评估]\n    J --&gt;|未达标| C</pre><p>训练收敛后不要立刻上线：先用<strong>留出的真实文档集</strong>（而非合成集）做一次全链路评测，因为合成集上的 CER 会系统性高估真实表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度校准-让-0-9-分真的意味着-90\">置信度校准：让 0.9 分真的意味着 90%</h2><p>CTC 输出的逐帧 softmax 概率与「整行正确」的概率<strong>不是一回事</strong>，而且深度网络普遍<strong>过度自信</strong>：Guo 等发现现代深度网络在准确率提升的同时校准反而变差（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.04599\">arXiv:1706.04599</a>）。工程上必须区分两个量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>序列置信度</strong>：对 CTC，可用路径概率的近似（如 best-path 概率）或对所有对齐取期望；对注意力解码器，可用长度归一化的对数似然。</li>\n<li><strong>校准后置信度</strong>：把原始分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 通过温度缩放映射，使输出概率与实际正确率对齐：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>T</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>correct</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = \\sigma\\!\\left(\\frac{z}{T}\\right), \\qquad T^{*} = \\arg\\min_T \\; \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\,\\big|\\,\\hat{p} - \\mathbb{1}[\\text{correct}]\\,\\big|\\,\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 在<strong>验证集</strong>上拟合，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（软化过度自信）。校准的验收指标是<strong>期望校准误差 ECE</strong>：把预测分桶，比较每桶平均置信度与桶内实际准确率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ECE</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>acc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>conf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ECE} = \\sum_{m=1}^{M} \\frac{|B_m|}{n} \\,\\big|\\,\\text{acc}(B_m) - \\text{conf}(B_m)\\,\\big|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ECE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ECE 越低说明「说的分数」与「实际对的概率」越吻合。校准好了，下游才能设一个<strong>有依据的阈值</strong>：例如「置信度 &lt; 0.85 的行送人工复核」，此时 0.85 大约对应 85% 正确率，复核量可预测。若不做校准，同样的阈值可能实际只对应 60% 正确率，抽检预算会完全失准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后处理-词典校正-语言模型与规则门控\">后处理：词典校正、语言模型与规则门控</h2><p>后处理是「用领域先验修正统计模型」的地方，收益高但风险也高——过度校正会把本来正确的罕见字符串「纠正」成词典里的常见词。常见手段按侵入性排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本规范化</td>\n<td>全角转半角、去多余空格、统一引号</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>低（需保留 O/0 等区分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符级纠错</td>\n<td>编辑距离匹配到近邻字符</td>\n<td>已知易混字符集</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词典约束解码</td>\n<td>用领域词典给 CTC/注意力加约束</td>\n<td>有固定词表的字段</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言模型重排</td>\n<td>N-gram/神经 LM 给候选打分</td>\n<td>自然语言文本</td>\n<td>高（幻觉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段规则门控</td>\n<td>正则/校验位校验金额、日期、IBAN</td>\n<td>结构化字段</td>\n<td>低（只做拒绝）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计原则是<strong>区分「纠正」与「拒识」</strong>：金额、订单号这类不能猜的字段，只允许规则门控做<strong>校验与拒绝</strong>（校验位失败就标记为低可信），不允许 LM 去「补全」缺失数字。而厂商名、地址这类自然语言字段，才适合词典与 LM 校正。</p>\n<p>跨境电商单据里一个高价值门控示例：<strong>金额字段</strong>必须同时满足 (a) 与币种符号共现、(b) 千分位/小数点格式合法、(c) 与下游小计/税额做算术一致性校验。这三条规则能拦掉大量「识别对但抽取错位」的错误，其价值远高于再提升 0.5% 的字符准确率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线验收-cer-字段准确率与校准误差三件套\">上线验收：CER、字段准确率与校准误差三件套</h2><p>引擎训练的完成标准不是「loss 收敛」，而是三项指标同时达标。整行 CER 只反映字符级表现，字段准确率才反映业务价值，ECE 反映可信度是否可用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型门槛（票据场景）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测 F1</td>\n<td>文本框 IoU 匹配后的 F-measure</td>\n<td>≥ 0.92</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行 CER</td>\n<td>编辑距离 / 参考长度</td>\n<td>≤ 2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段准确率</td>\n<td>完全匹配的字段比例</td>\n<td>≥ 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECE</td>\n<td>分桶置信度误差</td>\n<td>≤ 0.03</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OCR 引擎的工程质量，取决于网络结构之外的四个决策。<strong>合成数据</strong>走 L3 文档合成路线，把扫描退化链（模糊、压缩损伤、印章叠加、透视扰动）显式建模，并以真实数据按比例混合抑制域差。<strong>字典</strong>是识别头的输出空间，需做 OOV 审计、妥善处理 CTC blank，并按语言选择字符表或 BPE 子词。<strong>训练</strong>上困难样本挖掘与字段难度加权的收益常大于换主干。<strong>校准与后处理</strong>把统计分数变成生产可用的阈值与门控——用 ECE 验收校准，把「纠正」留给自然语言字段、把「拒识」留给不可猜的结构化字段。最终验收看检测 F1、行 CER、字段准确率与 ECE 四项，上线后按漂移监控触发针对性微调，而非盲目重训。下一章 <a href=\"../layout-table-form-extraction/\"><code>../3_layout-table-form-extraction/INDEX.md</code></a> 将在此之上展开版面与表格结构抽取。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OCR 引擎训练与后处理：数据合成、字典建模与置信度校准","id":"ocr-引擎训练与后处理-数据合成-字典建模与置信度校准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"训练数据引擎：真实标注换不来的，靠合成补","id":"训练数据引擎-真实标注换不来的-靠合成补"},{"level":2,"text":"字典建模：字符集就是模型的输出空间","id":"字典建模-字符集就是模型的输出空间"},{"level":2,"text":"训练目标与困难样本挖掘","id":"训练目标与困难样本挖掘"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度校准：让 0.9 分真的意味着 90%","id":"置信度校准-让-0-9-分真的意味着-90"},{"level":2,"text":"后处理：词典校正、语言模型与规则门控","id":"后处理-词典校正-语言模型与规则门控"},{"level":2,"text":"上线验收：CER、字段准确率与校准误差三件套","id":"上线验收-cer-字段准确率与校准误差三件套"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文字检测与识别原理：DBNet/CRNN 结构、CTC 与注意力解码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/ocr-detection-recognition-engine/text-detection-recognition-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"OCR 质量评测与部署运营：CER/WER 度量、badcase 归因与推理加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/ocr-detection-recognition-engine/ocr-quality-metric-deployment-ops"}}